# ==========================================
# Machine Learning & Large Files
# ==========================================
# GitHub has a strict 100MB file limit. 
# Your Qwen LoRA adapter is ~72MB, which is safe. 
# If any .pkl or .safetensors file exceeds 100MB, you MUST use Git LFS or provide a download link in your README instead.
*.h5
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

